{"page":45,"width":1910,"height":2825,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"1.9 커널자료구조 41","words":[{"text":"1.9","x":1374,"y":184,"width":52,"height":25},{"text":"커널자료구조","x":1445,"y":183,"width":160,"height":29},{"text":"41","x":1683,"y":178,"width":37,"height":30}]},{"text":"다. 상점의 계산대에서 기다리는 사람들과 교통신호를 기다리는 자동차-들이 그 예이다.","words":[{"text":"다.","x":347,"y":327,"width":39,"height":39},{"text":"상점의","x":407,"y":327,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"계산대에서","x":529,"y":327,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"기다리는","x":717,"y":327,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"사람들과","x":868,"y":326,"width":139,"height":41},{"text":"교통신호를","x":1021,"y":325,"width":175,"height":41},{"text":"기다리는","x":1213,"y":325,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"자동차-들이","x":1367,"y":322,"width":171,"height":42},{"text":"그","x":1558,"y":328,"width":36,"height":27},{"text":"예이다.","x":1611,"y":322,"width":115,"height":42}]},{"text":"큐는 운영체제에서도 대단히 흔히 A卜%된다. 예를 들면, 프린터에 보내진 작업은 전형적","words":[{"text":"큐는","x":346,"y":392,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"운영체제에서도","x":429,"y":392,"width":243,"height":40},{"text":"대단히","x":689,"y":392,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"흔히","x":804,"y":393,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"A卜%된다.","x":887,"y":392,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"예를","x":1049,"y":392,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"들면,","x":1131,"y":391,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"프린터에","x":1224,"y":391,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"보내진","x":1378,"y":390,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"작업은","x":1497,"y":389,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"전형적","x":1621,"y":389,"width":102,"height":41}]},{"text":"으로 제출된 순서대로 인쇄된다. 우리가 5장에서 살펴보겠지만 CPU에서 수행을 기다리","words":[{"text":"으로","x":346,"y":458,"width":69,"height":31},{"text":"제출된","x":430,"y":456,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"순서대로","x":546,"y":457,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"인쇄된다.","x":699,"y":457,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"우리가","x":856,"y":458,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"5장에서","x":971,"y":457,"width":120,"height":41},{"text":"살펴보겠지만","x":1109